    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brimming with character and timeless elegance, this beautifully presented three-bedroom townhouse offers the perfect balance of period charm and modern-day comfort. Situated on the Glengarriff Road, the property enjoys a highly convenient location within easy walking distance of Bantry town centre and its excellent range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, and everyday amenities.\r\nBeautifully decorated throughout, the home retains many original features that enhance its unique appeal, including warm timber floors, traditional sash windows, and original fireplaces, all combining to create a welcoming atmosphere full of old-world charm.\r\nThe ground floor offers an effortless flow from the cosy living room to the elegant dining room, making it an ideal space for both everyday living and entertaining. French doors open onto a delightful private stepped garden, providing a peaceful outdoor area for al fresco dining or simply relaxing.\r\nThe combination of period character, tasteful interiors, and an exceptionally convenient location makes this charming townhouse an excellent option for those seeking a distinctive home in the heart of Bantry.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nPrivate rear garden\r\nOFCH\r\nMains Services\r\n\r\nAll information is provided in good faith and believed to be correct; however, it is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No representations or warranties, express or implied, are made as to the accuracy, completeness, condition, or planning status of the property.\r\nInterested parties should investigate independently as to the accuracy of all details, including measurements, boundaries, area, BER rating, and available services. In addition, all apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services should be thoroughly tested to assess their working condition. \r\nPhotographs and videos are for guidance purposes only  and may show items (such as furniture) that are not included in the sale unless specifically agreed between the parties."
      },
